0 FILE lumen-iris.ldr
0 Lumen - Six-leaf iris
0 Name: lumen-iris.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/lumen-iris.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Lumen design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // A stock 60T hollow turntable drives six 20T leaf gears and a real variable aperture.
0 // Original six-leaf gearing, aperture geometry, frame and native program; one input motor A.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: lumen-iris.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Mechanism demonstrator; physical assembly and optical sealing are untested.
